  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, bring the water (for the rice) to boil.\n• Add jasmine rice, stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 10 mins, then remove the pan from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and all the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-e6df4b00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice zucchini into half-moons. Cut capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Cut Japanese tofu into 2cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine sweet soy seasoning, honey and soy sauce and water (for the sauce)\n• In a small bowl, combine sriracha (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-eee6d110.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook capsicum and zucchini, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a bowl.\n• Return pan to medium-high heat and cook tofu, tossing until browned, 3-4 mins. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded.\n• And add honey soy mixture and veggies, tossing until well combined, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-c3892420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice and tofu stir fry between bowls.\n• Drizzle with sriracha mayo.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6907ee6e79e2c370e48f55fb/step-e7c4f330.jpg"
    }
  ]
